    <!-- §0.4 Q6, verbatim; PRIVACY.md says the same (PrivacyDocTest). -->
    <string name="settings_area_rationale">Kirakira Basket can use your approximate area to find tonight’s sunset and the local forecast for its weather surprises. Your area stays on this phone; only the forecast request names the nearest city.</string>
